o vents, carpet spotting, moving furniture and other as assigned. Percentage Of Time 10 Essential Function: No Responsibility Area: Clean Equipment Duties: Clean all equipment after every usage. Percentage Of Time 5 Essential Function: No Responsibility Area: Change Light Bulbs Duties: Change light bulbs. Percentage Of Time 5 Essential Function: No Responsibility Area: Emergencies Duties: Respond to emergencies, (flood etc) Percentage Of Time 5 Essential Function: No Responsibility Area: Set Ups Duties: Participate in set ups. Percentage Of Time 5 Essential Function: No Required and Preferred Qualifications Required Education Required Experience The work environment characteristics described here are representative of those an employee encounters while performing the essential functions of this job. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions. Regularly works indoors. Noise level is low to moderate. Required License/Certification Required Additional Qualifications: Requires the ability to understand and follow instructions and to perform medium to heavy physical labor, to work effectively on a team and independently, to interact courteously with a variety of people. Criminal background check and drug screen required of successful candidate. Preferred Education Preferred Experience Preferred License/Certification Preferred Additional Qualifications: Compliance Requirements Credit Check No Motor Vehicle Licensing Validity Check No Pre-employment Physical Request and Assessment Yes Drug Screen Yes Supplemental Question Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Optional Documents Cover Letter University of Nebraska-Lincoln University of Nebraska Medical Center UNO is an EO/Affirmative Action Employer University of Nebraska System Office University of Nebraska at Kearney To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity 