sability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, and/or political affiliation in its education programs or activities, including admissions and employment. The University prohibits any form of retaliation taken against anyone for reporting discrimination, harassment, or retaliation for otherwise engaging in protected activity. Read the full statement. Job Title Custodian | Mon - Fri 7:00AM - 3:30PM | Student Center Job Grade FP02H Division Business and Finance College/Dept Auxiliary Services Department Milo Bail Student Center Business Office Requisition Number 2026-00271 FTE (full-time equivalency) 100.00 Work Schedule M-F 7:00AM - 3:30PM with rotating Saturday Shift Does the position provide the opportunity to work Remotely/Telecommuting? No remote/telecommute opportunity Appointment Term 12- 12/12 months Is this position essential personnel according to the inclement weather policy? No Pay Information $15.00 per/hr Pay Schedule Hourly FLSA Designation Non-Exempt Position Summary Perform custodial duties for Milo Bail Student Center. Ensure all areas remain safe and sanitary for use by all students, faculty, staff, and guests. Handle setting up event rooms before and after events while also providing customer service to events as they are happening. Job Duties Responsibility Area: Clean/Monitor Different Spaces Around the MBSC Duties: Clean/monitor event spaces, offices, entry ways, lounges, dining spaces, and hallways/stairwells. Percentage Of Time 25 Essential Function: Yes Responsibility Area: Clean and Restock Restrooms Duties: Clean and restock restrooms on a daily basis. Percentage Of Time 10 Essential Function: Yes Responsibility Area: Set Up Event Spaces Duties: Set up event spaces with tables, chairs, staging, technology, and other event equipment. Percentage Of Time 25 Essential Function: Yes Responsibility Area: Daily Cleaning Duties Duties: Vacuum, dust, empty trash and perform other cleaning duties to assigned areas on a daily basis. Percentage Of Time 10 Essential Function: Yes Responsibility Area: Clean/Organize Equipment Used Duties: Clean and put away all equipment after each usage. Percentage Of Time 10 Essential Function: Yes Responsibility Area: Assist in Event Oversight Duties: Assist in event oversight when events are taking place in building Percentage Of Time 10 Essential Function: Yes Responsibility Area: Policy Enforcement and Customer Service Duties: Enforce building policies and procedures. Provide customer service to clients in building. Percentage Of Time 10 Essential Function: Yes Required and Preferred Qualifications Required Education Requires the ability to understand and follow instructions and to perform medium to heavy physical labor, to work effectively on a team and independently, to interact courteously with a variety of people. Criminal background check and drug screen required of successful candidate. Required Experience Requires the ability to understand and follow instructions and to perform medium to heavy physical labor, to work effectively on a team and independently, to interact courteously with a variety of people. Criminal background check and drug screen required of successful candidate. Required License/Certification None Required Additional Qualifications: Requires the ability to understand and follow instructions and to perform medium to heavy physical labor, to work effectively on a team and independently, to interact courteously with a variety of people. Criminal background check and drug screen required of successful candidate Preferred Education None Preferred Experience Custodial or event setup experience Preferred License/Certification Preferred Additional Qualifications: Compliance Requirements Credit Check No Motor Vehicle Licensing Validity Check No Pre-employment Physical Request and Assessment Yes Drug Screen Yes Supplemental Question Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Optional Documents Cover Letter Letter of Recommendation University of Nebraska-Lincoln University of Nebraska Medical Center UNO is an EO/Affirmative Action Employer University of Nebraska System Office University of Nebraska at Kearney To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
