gned areas on a daily basis. Percentage Of Time 10 Essential Function: Yes Responsibility Area: Clean/Organize Equipment Used Duties: Clean and put away all equipment after each usage. Percentage Of Time 10 Essential Function: Yes Responsibility Area: Assist in Event Oversight Duties: Assist in event oversight when events are taking place in building Percentage Of Time 10 Essential Function: Yes Responsibility Area: Policy Enforcement and Customer Service Duties: Enforce building policies and procedures. Provide customer service to clients in building. Percentage Of Time 10 Essential Function: Yes Required and Preferred Qualifications Required Education Requires the ability to understand and follow instructions and to perform medium to heavy physical labor, to work effectively on a team and independently, to interact courteously with a variety of people. Criminal background check and drug screen required of successful candidate. Required Experience Requires the ability to understand and follow instructions and to perform medium to heavy physical labor, to work effectively on a team and independently, to interact courteously with a variety of people. Criminal background check and drug screen required of successful candidate. Required License/Certification None Required Additional Qualifications: Requires the ability to understand and follow instructions and to perform medium to heavy physical labor, to work effectively on a team and independently, to interact courteously with a variety of people. Criminal background check and drug screen required of successful candidate Preferred Education None Preferred Experience Custodial or event setup experience Preferred License/Certification Preferred Additional Qualifications: Compliance Requirements Credit Check No Motor Vehicle Licensing Validity Check No Pre-employment Physical Request and Assessment Yes Drug Screen Yes Supplemental Question Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Optional Documents Cover Letter Letter of Recommendation University of Nebraska-Lincoln University of Nebraska Medical Center UNO is an EO/Affirmative Action Employer University of Nebraska System Office University of Nebraska at Kearney To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
